from pathlib import Path
root=Path(__file__).parent
marks=[
 ('Gauge ring','gauge-ring','An open gauge with a quiet, readable silhouette.', '<path d="M46 77a34 34 0 1 1 36 0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M64 63l15-18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>'),
 ('Meter V','meter-v','A V built from two level meters.', '<path d="M32 34l28 62M68 96l28-62" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="12" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M40 52l6-3M47 68l6-3M82 65l6 3M89 49l6 3" stroke="#171c21" stroke-width="4"/>'),
 ('Quiet pulse','quiet-pulse','A softer pulse, with one rounded rise.', '<path d="M20 73h21c8 0 9-30 20-30s12 42 22 42c8 0 8-12 15-12h10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>'),
 ('Stacked slices','stacked-slices','Four resource bars in a compact stack.', '<g fill="currentColor"><rect x="29" y="27" width="70" height="12" rx="6"/><rect x="29" y="48" width="55" height="12" rx="6"/><rect x="29" y="69" width="42" height="12" rx="6"/><rect x="29" y="90" width="63" height="12" rx="6"/></g>'),
 ('Vital dot','vital-dot','A single point inside a protective ring.', '<circle cx="64" cy="64" r="35" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"/><circle cx="64" cy="64" r="13" fill="currentColor"/>')]
def svg(mark,app=False):
 bg='<rect x="4" y="4" width="120" height="120" rx="29" fill="#171c21"/><rect x="4.5" y="4.5" width="119" height="119" rx="28.5" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-opacity=".12"/>' if app else ''
 return '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 128 128" aria-hidden="true">'+bg+('<g style="color:#84e0c1">' if app else '<g>')+mark+'</g></svg>'
for name,slug,desc,mark in marks:
 (root/(slug+'.svg')).write_text(svg(mark,True))
 (root/(slug+'-menubar.svg')).write_text(svg(mark))
style='''<style>
:root{color-scheme:light dark}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font:14px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;color:var(--foreground)}.choices{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:20px}.choices button{background:var(--secondary);color:var(--foreground);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 12px;font:inherit}.choices button[aria-pressed=true]{border-color:var(--primary);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--primary)}.stage{display:grid;grid-template-columns:180px 1fr;gap:24px;align-items:center;padding:20px 0}.app{width:160px;height:160px}.app svg{width:100%;height:100%}.name{font-size:23px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px}.desc{color:var(--muted-foreground);margin:0;line-height:1.5}.label{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted-foreground);margin:22px 0 8px}.menu{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-radius:9px;padding:0 16px;height:40px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500}.menu.light{background:#e6e8e9;color:#202327}.menu.dark{background:#25292e;color:#fff;margin-top:8px}.right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}.menu svg{height:18px;width:18px;display:block}.sizes{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;height:65px;color:var(--foreground)}.sizes svg{display:block}.sizes span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted-foreground)}.sizes svg{color:var(--foreground)}@media(max-width:450px){.stage{grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:16px}.app{width:110px;height:110px}.name{font-size:20px}.choices button{padding:9px}.menu{padding:0 10px}.right{gap:10px}}
</style>'''
buttons=''.join(f'<button type="button" data-index="{i}" aria-pressed="{str(i==0).lower()}">{name}</button>' for i,(name,*_) in enumerate(marks))
panes=''
for i,(name,slug,desc,mark) in enumerate(marks):
 sym=svg(mark); app=svg(mark,True)
 panes+=f'''<section class="variant" data-variant="{name}" {'' if i==0 else 'hidden'} aria-label="{name} logo concept"><div class="stage"><div class="app">{app}</div><div><h2 class="name">{name}</h2><p class="desc">{desc}</p></div></div><p class="label">Menu bar · actual icon size</p><div class="menu light"><span>Finder &nbsp; File &nbsp; Edit &nbsp; View</span><span class="right">{sym}<span>Wi-Fi</span><span>100%</span><span>9:41</span></span></div><div class="menu dark"><span>Finder &nbsp; File &nbsp; Edit &nbsp; View</span><span class="right">{sym}<span>Wi-Fi</span><span>100%</span><span>9:41</span></span></div><p class="label">Monochrome · small-size check</p><div class="sizes"><span><i style="width:16px;height:16px">{sym}</i>16 px</span><span><i style="width:22px;height:22px">{sym}</i>22 px</span><span><i style="width:32px;height:32px">{sym}</i>32 px</span></div></section>'''
script='''<script>const root=document.getElementById('vital-logos');root.querySelectorAll('[data-index]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const i=Number(button.dataset.index);root.querySelectorAll('.variant').forEach((pane,j)=>pane.hidden=i!==j);root.querySelectorAll('[data-index]').forEach((b,j)=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(i===j)));}));</script>'''
html='<!doctype html><html><head><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">'+style+'</head><body><main id="vital-logos"><nav class="choices" aria-label="Logo concepts">'+buttons+'</nav><div aria-live="polite">'+panes+'</div></main>'+script+'</body></html>'
(root/'vital-logo-concepts.html').write_text(html)
